Z||000002||Formula88||03-14-2001||08:17 PM||||Oil blowby cuz the rings haven't seated, yet?  Any oil coming out the exhaust would get sucked into the EGR.  Other than that, I dunno.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/confused.gif">||||reg||5
